  "id": 8860102820039,
  "title": "Custom Inspirational Floral Butterfly Bible Verse Blanket - D4",
  "handle": "custom-inspirational-floral-butterfly-bible-verse-blanket-d4",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in faith and comfort with this personalized Christian blanket from Jeminise, designed to bring warmth, peace, and daily encouragement to your home. Featuring uplifting bible verses and a soft, skin-friendly fabric, it's a perfect keepsake for believers.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An inspirational religious throw blanket, ideal for birthdays, Christmas, or baptisms, offering a heartfelt gift for women and girls.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with a name or date to create a one-of-a-kind Jesus Christ blanket, cherished by those who value faith-filled homes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> Blends soft, skin-friendly fleece with scripture, providing warmth, peace, and daily encouragement during prayer and quiet time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from three convenient sizes: 30x40 inches, 50x60 inches, or 60x80 inches.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Features a modern design with patterns including butterflies, floral, cloud, and cross, centered around a religious and Christmas theme.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from a blend of Polycotton and Polyester fill, with a soft fabric type that is lightweight and cozy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and fluffs up beautifully.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>D14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas, Religious</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>butterflies, floral, cloud, cross</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Customizable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
